        <div class="faq-cat">
          The Ingredients
        </div>

      
  
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-q-text">What are bio-retinoids and how are they different from retinol?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>

          <div class="faq-a">
            <div class="faq-a-inner">
              <p>Retinol converts to retinoic acid in the skin, the process that causes purging, sun sensitivity, and the reason most dermatologists say "start slow." Our sun-safe bio-retinoids are designed to deliver retinoid benefits without that conversion burden, which is why there is no purge, no sun restriction, and they are safe to use AM and PM.</p><p>The result is a gentler experience with better tolerance, so you can stay consistent for the full protocol instead of cycling on and off.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    
  
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-q-text">What is the stem cell technology in the serum?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon"></span>
          </button>

          <div class="faq-a">
            <div class="faq-a-inner">
              <p>Our Stem Cell Conditioned Media is derived from adipose-derived stem cells and originated in clinical aesthetic medicine in South Korea. It works by delivering the growth factors and signalling proteins that prompt the skin's own repair processes.</p><p>It's the same category of material used in clinical settings, not a cosmetic marketing flourish. It sits in the formula at a meaningful concentration, not a trace level added for the label.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    
  
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
