            <div class="faq-a-inner">
              <p>Yes. The formulas pair the familiar with the exotic. Niacinamide and vitamin C, the actives you already know and trust, do the foundational work of evening tone and supporting the barrier.</p><p>Alongside them sit the next-generation actives most brands can't access: sun-safe bio-retinoids, stem cell conditioned media, marine biotic factors. Proven and advanced, in the same bottle.</p>
            </div>
